# auto-imports.d.ts and components.d.ts are generated by unplugin-auto-import and
# unplugin-vue-components - and committed on purpose. They are the only declarations for `ref`,
# `useI18n` and every F7 component, so without them a fresh clone cannot type-check: CI failed on
# 200 "Cannot find name" errors from a checkout that had never run the dev server.
# Regenerate by running `vp dev` or `vp build`; commit the diff when imports change.

# The native project is generated by `npx cap add android` and carries an application id, a Java
# package and a keystore config. Committing it here would hand every generated app this template's
# identity, so it stays out - the creator skips it too.
android
ios
